GRAPH <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Narrative_ContainedPainOverUnboundedRisk> {
  <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Narrative_ContainedPainOverUnboundedRisk> a narr:Digest ;
    narr:digestOf <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_ContainedPainOverUnboundedRisk> ;
